When Should You Get Help?

Persistent itching, burning, swelling, rash, or significant skin irritation should not simply be assumed to be caused by your period. Consider speaking with a healthcare professional if symptoms continue.

Conclusion

Heavy-flow days require both protection and comfort. Regular pad changes, breathable clothing, and suitable menstrual products can help support a more comfortable routine.

